# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 65-125
section Mining 65-125

step Smelt Bronze & Smelt Tin
  tip At 65 a Mining trainer teaches Smelt Bronze (2s; grey at 115) and Smelt Tin (50c; grey at 75): smelting at a forge raises Mining too, so smelt what you mine.
  learn 2659
  learn 3304

step Copper & Tin: Loch Modan (65-125)
  only Human,Dwarf,Gnome,Skyborne,Alliance
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Walk the loop and mine every Copper (1, green), Tin (65, orange) node on the way until Mining 125. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: Smelt Copper (orange to 25, grey at 70), Smelt Tin (grey at 75), Smelt Bronze (grey at 115) give points too. Smelt Bronze takes a Copper Bar and a Tin Bar each: keep bars from the smelts before it. A quest here needs Mining: Ingredients for the Forge (level 30, Morhan Coppertongue). The loop asks level 14: no creature on it is more than a level above that, and it keeps clear of the other faction's towns. A lap is about 2,800 yards, 7 minutes with the stops; the arrow leads stop to stop. Expect about 360 nodes for these 60 points: about 305 Copper Ore, 210 Rough Stone, 45 Tin Ore, 30 Coarse Stone, 25 Blood Shard and 10 Pyrite. For Blacksmithing: about 370 Copper Ore, 285 Rough Stone, 160 Tin Ore and 255 Coarse Stone in all. For Engineering: about 230 Copper Ore, 45 Rough Stone, 80 Tin Ore and 45 Coarse Stone in all. Smelt Silver (2s; orange to 100, grey at 125) is taught from 75: learn it if you pass a Mining trainer, it is not worth a trip of its own.
  level 14
  loop
  goto 25.7,45.5 "Copper, Tin" r 60
  goto 26.7,57.4 "Copper, Tin" r 60
  goto 29.3,72.4 "Tin" r 60
  goto 35.1,57.1 "Copper" r 60
  goto 45.8,61.5 "Copper" r 60
  goto 36.0,15.7 "Copper, Tin" r 60
  goto 26.0,31.3 "Copper" r 60
  goto 22.7,31.5 "Tin" r 60
  skill Mining 125

