# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 125-155
section Mining 125-155

step Expert Mining
  tip Expert Mining raises the cap to 225; it needs skill 125 and no character level, and costs 50s: train it as soon as you reach 125. The arrow picks the nearest Mining trainer of your faction. Learn Smelt Iron (5s; orange to 130, grey at 140) on the same visit: smelting at a forge raises Mining too, so smelt what you mine.
  train Mining Expert
  learn 3307

step Iron: Duskwood (125-155)
  only Alliance
  zone Duskwood
  tip Walk the loop and mine every Tin (65, green), Silver (75, green), Iron (125, orange) node on the way until Mining 155. Smelt at a forge when your bags fill: Smelt Iron (orange to 130, grey at 140) gives points too. The loop asks level 24: no creature on it is more than a level above that, and it keeps clear of the other faction's towns. A lap is about 900 yards, 2 minutes with the stops; the arrow leads stop to stop. Expect about 60 nodes for these 30 points: about 30 Tin Ore, 25 Iron Ore, 20 Heavy Stone, 20 Coarse Stone, 5 Blood Shard and 5 Silver Ore. For Blacksmithing: about 160 Tin Ore, 365 Iron Ore, 260 Heavy Stone and 255 Coarse Stone in all. For Engineering: about 80 Tin Ore, 80 Iron Ore, 100 Heavy Stone, 45 Coarse Stone and 10 Silver Ore in all.
